BOSS Scorchion Engage Reset Q
    Events
        Time - BossScorchionDarkShamansRTimer expires
    Conditions
    Actions
        Unit - Make BossScorchion Vulnerable
        Unit - Set Unit: BossScorchion's Real Field: Hit Points Regeneration Rate ('uhpr') to Value: 1000.00
        Special Effect - Destroy BossScorchionStartFx
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BossScorchionDarkShamans and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Unit - Remove (Picked unit) from the game
        -------- Allow engaging dark shamans --------
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Scorchion Engage Worshippers <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Start <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Engage Reset <gen>
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Scorchion_Engage_During_Lines)
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionDarkShamansR_ON = False
        Set VariableSet DarkShamansInCombat = False
        -------- Start Timer to Create new Dark Shamans --------
        Countdown Timer - Start BossScorchionResetTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 5.00 seconds
        Countdown Timer - Pause BossScorchionEngageFacingTimer
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionDarkShamansLine = (Random integer number between 1 and 3)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossScorchionDarkShamansLine Equal to 1
                (All units of BossScorchionDarkShamans are dead) Equal to False
            Then - Actions
