                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Run, little coward! The spirits have abandoned you!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("DarkShaman_0012", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from (Random unit from BossScorchionDarkShamans) named Dark Shaman: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Don't wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
